nfig.py variable names need care, so I did not add one. Today Docker installations can only use the default of one hour."}],"harness_used":["AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md: commands table (make check-fast, migrations-check, test), the conventions on migrations and gettext, and the rule to add a harness log entry","The --create-db versus --reuse-db note in AGENTS.md","docs/harness/log.md format","make db-up / make migrations-check targets"],"harness_gaps":[{"file":"Makefile","problem":"`make test` and `make check` always call `make db-up`, which fails when another worktree's compose PostgreSQL already uses port 5432. There is no option for another port or test database name."},{"file":"tests/config.py","problem":"The test database name is fixed, and no environment variable can change it, so parallel worktrees can overwrite each other's test_taiga database. I had to write a settings module outside the repo to isolate the full run."},{"file":"AGENTS.md","problem":"Nothing says how to run the whole suite with parallel worktrees. The suite takes about 14 minutes without coverage, which is longer than an agent's default 10-minute background limit, and nothing warns about this."}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2854,"cache_read_input_tokens":63703,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2854},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4fcdc8a8-cd51-42fd-846a-abc56cbc1d0e","uuid":"e2af9ca8-8173-4934-a41f-9371e99a5c00","timestamp":"2026-11-02T00:51:18.120Z","request_id":"req_011CgdBfCZyvZuLe5J9Fqs8y","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01M7t2n7hrgjwoNDc36tYEn9":{"status":"done","summary":"Password recovery tokens now expire. There is a new setting, PASSWORD_RECOVERY_TOKEN_L